        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PBB SA8160, 6\" Single Acting Spring Hinge</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with a Pair (2) Single Action Spring Door Hinges plus #12 x 1-1/4\" wood  screws and 12-24 x 1/2\" machine screws.  Non-template screw hole pattern for use on metal or wood doors (ANSI K81011F). This is a replacement for Bommer 4010-6-600 hinge.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the PBB SA8160 6\" Spring Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Durable Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-1/2”</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square Corners</li>\r\n<li>Gauge of Metal: .100</li>\r\n<li>Screws size: FHMS - 12-24 x 1/2” and FHWS - 12 x 1-1/4”</li>\r\n<li>Door Weight: 125 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed</li>\r\n<li>BHMA Certified <b>Grade 2</b>.</li>\r\n<li><b>UL Listed For Fire Rated Door Applications</b> </li>\r\n<li>Full Mortise - ANSI K81011F</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PBB-SA8160-specifications.pdf?v=1718159614\" target=\"new\"><b>PBB SA8160 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<!-- START Bommer 4010 -->\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#990000\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"special-items-table\">\r\n<tr height=\"30\">\r\n<td colspan=\"6\" align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\">\r\n    <span class=\"h-green\">PBB-SA8170 Hinge Selection for Maximum Door Size</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"24\"> \r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"70\">PBB Hinge Number</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">2 Hinges</td>\r\n<td colspan=\"2\" width=\"170\">3 Hinges</td>\r\n<td rowspan=\"2\" width=\"130\">Door Thickness</td>\r\n\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Weight</td>\r\n<td  width=\"85\">Door Width</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr height=\"40\">\r\n<td>SA8160</td>\r\n<td>125 lbs</td>\r\n<td>3'-0\"</td>\r\n<td>155 lbs</td>\r\n